      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "用手中的Soul Taker夺取并吞食敌人灵魂，变形成映射对手能力的战斗形态。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "By eating the souls you take, you can transform into a soul style that reflects your opponent's abilities!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2191770/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "把“记忆”与“灵魂形态”自由组合，在恢复身份的过程中形成个人战斗方式。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Find your own way of fighting by combining “Memory” and “Soul Style” to strengthen yourself!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2191770/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
